From: MGG <178586019+GG-MD@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 17:01:31 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Skip precipitation ticks without rain or water

Without rain a precipitation tick can only freeze water below the top block,
and Biome#shouldFreeze returns false unless that block is a water source block.
Check the block state from the ticking chunk first and return before the biome lookup and
the freeze checks when there is nothing to freeze. The result is the same as before.

Uses the performance.optimize-tick-precipitation option from the Optimize tickPrecipitation patch.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerLevel.java b/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerLevel.java
index 98bd866ecdeee941d8c4e5a7a46f42c052968433..b882eb4ead9d70c58fadf3905df178a69828e8a6 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerLevel.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/server/level/ServerLevel.java
@@ -1342,6 +1342,14 @@ public class ServerLevel extends Level implements WorldGenLevel, ServerEntityGet
         final LevelChunk chunk = org.dreeam.leaf.config.modules.opt.OptimizeTickPrecipitation.enabled ? tickingChunk : null;
         BlockPos topPos = chunk == null ? this.getHeightmapPos(Heightmap.Types.MOTION_BLOCKING, pos) : new BlockPos(pos.getX(), chunk.getHeight(Heightmap.Types.MOTION_BLOCKING, pos.getX(), pos.getZ()) + 1, pos.getZ());
         BlockPos belowPos = topPos.below();
+        // Leaf start - Skip precipitation ticks without rain or water
+        if (chunk != null && !this.isRaining()) {
+            final BlockState belowState = chunk.getBlockState(belowPos);
+            if (!(belowState.getFluidState().is(net.minecraft.world.level.material.Fluids.WATER) && belowState.getBlock() instanceof net.minecraft.world.level.block.LiquidBlock)) {
+                return;
+            }
+        }
+        // Leaf end - Skip precipitation ticks without rain or water
         Biome biome = (chunk == null ? this.getBiome(topPos) : this.getBiomeManager().getBiomeCached(chunk, topPos)).value();
         // Leaf end - Optimize tickPrecipitation
         if (biome.shouldFreeze(this, belowPos)) {
